Using systematic-debugging to root-cause before fixing. Owned files only: `src/v1/BrandWaves.tsx`, `src/v1/side.css`.

**Fixes**
- `BrandWaves.tsx` (mobile `mob===1`): wave-1 top-band rows now clamped so every logo centre sits ≥ header (64px) + 16px + per-depth half-height reserve (near 24 / mid 19 / far 16), and the lower row stays inside the band. `mob===2` similarly clamped to centre ≤ H−72−24−half (skip top ≈72px from bottom).
- `side.css` (mobile bottom-band blocks): `padding-bottom: 4vh` → `max(4vh, calc(104px + safe-area))`, so reviews/lenses/brands content floors ≥24px above the skip control's top edge (28+44=72px → 72+24=96, +8 margin).

**Verify** (dev on port 5721, film s290 = wave-1 hold + brands panel)
- tsc `--noEmit`: clean.
- Measured: 390×844 — topmost logo 75px vs header bottom 56px → **19px gap** ✓; brands content bottom 740px vs skip top 772px → **32px gap** ✓. 360×780 — **21px** ✓ / **32px** ✓.
- Screenshots + LOOK: `docs/phase4/qa/v3/mobtweak-390x844-s290.png`, `docs/phase4/qa/v3/mobtweak-360x780-s290.png` — constellation clears the header hairline, EYEWEAR BRANDS / 8 floats well above SKIP FILM, no overlap on either viewport.
